description=IPv4 TTL / IPv6 HL=64 upstream; incoming 1 -> 2. Preserves outgoing ICMP/ICMPv6 TTL/HL for traceroute and IPv6 link-local control traffic. Kernel rules, no NFQUEUE or polling. Disables bypassing IPv4/IPv6 offload.
